  "desc": "Hand-operated wire rope puller (Tirfor-type) for pulling, lifting and tensioning — no drum required, so it stays compact and light. Moving the forward and backward levers feeds galvanised steel wire rope straight through two clamping jaws, giving unlimited travel and use at any working angle. A high-strength cast aluminium-alloy body keeps weight down, while a built-in shear pin protects against overload (shears at approx. 50% overload; spare pins are stored in the carrying handle). Supplied with a safety hook and reeled galvanised wire rope, proof-tested to 150% of rated capacity with an individual test certificate. Conforms to and tested per EN 13157+A1:2009.",
